OL,5,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FIn this episode the high-speed
OL,7,     Fpolice unit are in hot pursuit of
OL,8,     Fa transit van and later rescue a
OL,9,     Fman from an overturned tractor in
OL,10,     Fthe Essex countryside.
OL,11,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,12,     FHand-picked officers of the Essex
OL,13,     FPolice force tackle some of the
OL,14,     Fmost dangerous criminals in the
OL,15,     Fcountry. In this episode car
OL,16,     Fthieves steal a BMW.
