OL,5,G1700 Shoplifters: Caught Red Handed
OL,6,     FIn Newton Abbot, a pensioner is
OL,7,     Fshopping when a woman takes an
OL,8,     Fenvelope of money from her. In
OL,9,     FCoventry, Mal spots a suspected
OL,10,     Fdrug user who already has a
OL,11,     Flifetime ban. (Ep11)
OL,12,G1800 Home and Away
OL,13,     FEden fears a great loss.
OL,14,     FMackenzie's patience wears thin.
OL,15,     FDavid struggles to join the dots.
OL,16,G1830 Home and Away
OL,17,     FHarper is torn. Dana sets Levi a
OL,18,     Ffriendly challenge. Sonny stoops
OL,19,     Fto a new low. Remi babysits Archie
OL,20,     Ffor the first time.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
