OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FTwo grooms-to-be come to the
OL,7,     Fclinic with lumps they want to get
OL,8,     Frid of before their big days: Carl
OL,9,     Fhas multiple lipomas, while Alan
OL,10,     Fneeds a neck cyst removed.
OL,11,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,12,     FThe chilling story of a lodger
OL,13,     Ffrom Canterbury, Kent, who
OL,14,     Fmurdered his housemate and the
OL,15,     Fman's girlfriend after a row over
OL,16,     Fhot water.
